Goal: Finalize and validate the existing uncommitted work in this repository: fixes for DOG-037 and DOG-038 (see both entries in dogfood/findings/FINDINGS.md, the change_log.md entries, and the "Read-only roles go only to CLIs that enforce them" and "Network for workers is opt-in" paragraphs in documentation/ORCHESTRATE.md).

